  "equipment_type": "VRF BACnet gateway (multiple indoor units, Midea)",
  "applies_to": "Midea commercial and VRF air conditioning systems.",
  "summary": "Intesis 700 Series multi-protocol gateway set up for BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP on a Midea commercial/VRF system. It publishes gateway-wide commands, outdoor-unit error objects at (OU x 10000) and one block per indoor unit at (unit index x 100): on/off, mode, setpoint, standard and extended fan speed, swing and vane positions, room temperature, error codes, remote and per-mode locks, operating-mode force and energy consumption.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP",
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": true,
  "notes": [
    "Indoor unit instance = (IU x 100) + offset, IU = unit index in Intesis MAPS; index 1 is shown (100-112).",
    "Outdoor unit instance = (OU x 10000) + offset; OU 1 is shown (10000).",
    "The BACnet table has no read/write column; access is inferred from object type.",
    "Consumption objects report Wh or kWh as set in MAPS.",
    "The manual names INBACMID004I000 (listed separately) as its legacy order code."
  ],
  "source": {
    "title": "700 Series Air Gateway IN770AIR***O000 - Midea Commercial and VRF Systems to Modbus, KNX, BACnet, MQTT and Home Automation - User Manual",
    "doc_number": null,
    "revision_date": "2025-12-09 v1.0.22",
    "url": "https://www.hms-networks.com/docs/default-source/products/intesis/manuals-and-guides---manuals/user-manual-in770midxxxo000.pdf"
